Subject: [PATCH] fix(import): bound STEP edge and swept-curve subdivision

Meter edge and swept generator divisions with bounded refusal for non-finite probes, discontinuous knots and unresolved leaves. Preserve truck division output for healthy curves.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

